<title>USA: BOXING-TYSON STOPS SELDON IN FIRST TO WIN WBA TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-TYSON STOPS SELDON IN FIRST TO WIN WBA TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mike Tyson won the World Boxing Association heavyweight title by stopping Bruce Seldon at one minute, 49 seconds of the first round of their scheduled 12-round fight Saturday.</p>
</text>
